				"Production if BB are in superheated state: 16384 SU per Steam engine (2 steam engine for 1 BB in superheated state, max 18 steam engine for max 9 BB, max production: 294912 SU).You need a 3x3x8 tank over a 3x3 of BB with 18 steam engine on the tank to get the max production."
